start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch [3dc 2ch]x3}@ring ss@top
R2: ch=sc 2ch sc@sp [3ch sc@sp 2ch sc@sp]x3 3ch ss@top # sc worked into the gaps between the dc of round 1
R3: {3ch=dc 2dc}@sp [ch {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp]x3 ch {3dc 2ch}@sp ss@top # worked into the corner ch-2 spaces of round 1, behind round 2
R4: ch=sc 2ch sc@sp 2ch sc@sp 2ch sc@sp [3ch [sc@sp 2ch sc@sp]x2]x3 3ch ss@top # gaps between the dc of round 3
R5: {3ch=dc 2dc}@sp [ch 3dc@sp ch {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp]x3 ch 3dc@sp ch {3dc 2ch}@sp ss@top # into the spaces of round 3
R6: ch=sc 2ch sc@sp [2ch sc@sp 2ch sc@sp]x2 [3ch [sc@sp 2ch sc@sp]x3]x3 3ch ss@top fo # gaps between the dc of round 5
R7: {3ch=dc 2dc}@sp [[ch 3dc@sp]x2 ch {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp]x3 [ch 3dc@sp]x2 ch {3dc 2ch}@sp ss@top # into the spaces of round 5 (corners: 'round 3' as published)
R8: ch [[sc]>corner {2sc ch 2sc}@sp]x4 [sc]>end ss@top fo
